    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "思考与探索",
      "bbox": {
        "left": 0.08,
        "top": 0.43,
        "right": 0.19,
        "bottom": 0.46
      },
      "source_order": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "在图2－62中，设圆锥的母线长为l，圆锥的底面圆半径为r，你能计算圆锥的侧面积吗？",
      "bbox": {
        "left": 0.19,
        "top": 0.35,
        "right": 0.62,
        "bottom": 0.46
      },
      "source_order": 13
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "圆锥的侧面展开图是一个扇形。",
      "bbox": {
        "left": 0.28,
        "top": 0.47,
        "right": 0.53,
        "bottom": 0.52
      },
      "source_order": 14
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "这个扇形的弧长是圆锥底面圆周长，半径是圆锥的母线长，圆锥的侧面积为\n\nS=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot2\\pi r\\cdot l=\\pi rl。",
      "bbox": {
        "left": 0.58,
        "top": 0.47,
        "right": 0.86,
        "bottom": 0.59
      },
      "source_order": 15
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "例　用铁皮制作的圆锥形容器盖如图2－63所示，求这个容器盖铁皮的面积（精确到1 cm²）。",
      "bbox": {
        "left": 0.20,
        "top": 0.62,
        "right": 0.73,
        "bottom": 0.68
      },
      "source_order": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "visual_region",
      "content": "图2－63",
      "bbox": {
        "left": 0.68,
        "top": 0.64,
        "right": 0.90,
        "bottom": 0.78
      },
      "source_order": 17
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "50 cm",
      "bbox": {"left": 0.80, "top": 0.68, "right": 0.86, "bottom": 0.71},
      "source_order": 18
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "80 cm",
      "bbox": {"left": 0.75, "top": 0.76, "right": 0.84, "bottom": 0.79},
      "source_order": 19
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "解：圆锥形容器盖的底面圆周长为2π×40=80π。",
      "bbox": {
        "left": 0.20,
        "top": 0.69,
        "right": 0.66,
        "bottom": 0.74
      },
      "source_order": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "容器盖的面积",
      "bbox": {
        "left": 0.20,
        "top": 0.75,
        "right": 0.38,
        "bottom": 0.79
      },
      "source_order": 21
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "latex": "S=\\frac{1}{2}\\times80\\pi\\times50",
      "bbox": {
        "left": 0.32,
        "top": 0.79,
        "right": 0.60,
        "bottom": 0.83
      },
      "source_order": 22
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "latex": "\\approx 6\\,280。",
      "bbox": {
        "left": 0.35,
        "top": 0.84,
        "right": 0.52,
        "bottom": 0.87
      },
      "source_order": 23
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "答：这个圆锥形容器盖铁皮的面积约为6 280 cm²。",
      "bbox": {
        "left": 0.20,
        "top": 0.88,
        "right": 0.72,
        "bottom": 0.92
      },
      "source_order": 24
    },
    {
